You are an AI coding assistant working on SpacetimeWiki.

## Stack
SpacetimeDB (Rust module) + React 19 + Vite 8 + Tiptap editor

## Build & Test
- Build: `cd web && npm run build`
- Test: `cd web && npm test`
- Lint: check for warnings before committing

## Conventions
- Tiptap editor for rich text
- Outline-inspired UI/UX
- SPA with React Router
- API at port 8711, Vite at 5184

## Ports
- 5184 Vite dev server
- 8711 backend API
- 3001 STDB
- 3000 WebSocket

## Documentation
- AGENTS.md — full agent onboarding
- CLAUDE.md — Claude Code quickstart
- Makefile — build/test/lint targets (`make help`)
